01:15:37,500 --> 01:15:43,500
Lucky Number Slevin (also known as The Wrong Man in Australia) is a 2006 black comedy neo-noir
crime thriller film directed by Paul McGuigan and written by Jason Smilovic.

12
01:22:30,000 --> 01:22:36,000
The film stars Josh Hartnett, Lucy Liu, Bruce Willis,
Stanley Tucci, Ben Kingsley, and Morgan Freeman.

13
01:29:22,500 --> 01:29:28,500
Lucky Number Slevin was released in the United Kingdom on April 7, 2006, by Entertainment Film
Distributors, and in the United States on February 24, 2006, by MGM Distribution Co.

14
01:36:15,000 --> 01:36:21,000
The film explores themes of sniper, assassin,
assassination, gambling debt, identity.

